OL,3,AAn Indian film that nobody would
OL,4,Arelease is finally a hit - 18 awards
OL,5,Alater
OL,6,
OL,7,FA film about the tender love and quiet
OL,8,Floneliness of an elderly couple, which
OL,9,Ftook two years to reach cinemas after
OL,10,Fit was completed, is wowing critics and
OL,11,Faudiences across India.
OL,13,FThe 111-minute Pyre, directed by
OL,14,Ftelevision journalist-turned-filmmaker
OL,15,FVinod Kapri, also explores the pressing
OL,16,Fissue of outmigration which has left
OL,17,Fhundreds of picturesque Himalayan
OL,18,Fhamlets abandoned and turned them into
OL,19,Fghost villages. It further reflects on
OL,20,Fthe impact of climate change, which has
OL,21,Fmade the region's weather increasingly
OL,22,Fharsh.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
