OL,3,AAn Indian film that nobody would
OL,4,Arelease is finally a hit - 18 awards
OL,5,Alater
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn social media, many Indians have
OL,8,Fshared videos showing audiences leaving
OL,9,Ftheatres with tears in their eyes.
OL,10,FOthers have posted that they have not
OL,11,Fbeen so moved by a film in a long time.
OL,13,FThe film's lead actors, ordinary
OL,14,Fvillagers who had never faced a camera
OL,15,Fbefore, have also won praise from some
OL,16,Fof Bollywood's most respected figures,
OL,17,Fincluding Naseeruddin Shah and Anupam
OL,18,FKher.
